===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ḱlew-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|listenen}}, {{m|enm|listnen}}, alteration (due to {{cog|enm|listen|t=to listen, give heed to}}) of {{inh|en|ang|hlysnan|t=to listen}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hlusnijaną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*hlusnōną}} (compare {{cog|gmh|lüsenen}}), from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hlusēną}} (compare {{cog|goh|hlosēn}}), from {{der|en|ine-pro|*ḱlew-|t=to hear}} (compare {{cog|grc|κλαίω||I make known, famous}}, {{cog|cy|clywed||to hear}}, {{cog|la|clueō||I am famous}}, {{cog|lt|klausýti}}, {{cog|cu|слушати||to hear|sc=Cyrs}}, {{cog|sa|श्रोषति|tr=śróṣati}}. Related to {{m|en|loud}} and {{cog|de|lauschen}}.

